			<div class="content" id="post-content-4829797">
									

<p><strong>Seeking Greenlights:</strong> Yes</p>
<p><strong>Page Type:</strong> SCP Article</p>
<p><strong>Elevator Pitch:</strong> A total of 49 tombs(and one vacant tomb) located underground. The bodies belonged to a group of reality benders who could 'bless' (call it what you will) chosen areas and prevent anyone within those areas from ever getting injured or killed. As of now,their corpses now 'curse' people within 20 meters of them. It was something not even they knew the reason for.</p>
<p><strong>Central Narrative:</strong> The story will begin with the only known survivor of the group being discovered and interviewed in the former headquarters of the group. The survivor explains that over 23 years,they have researched and logged all areas affected by their 'blessings' in order to see where the best places to bless would be.</p>
<p>He further explains that the reason they have all passed away was due to the leader.(Who he refers to as &quot;The Willow&quot;) Her death caused a chain reaction upon all the members of the group to perish,leaving only the unnamed survivor to bury them.</p>
<p><strong>Hook:</strong> If you enjoy stories about the history of abandoned places,this could definitely intrigue you if I do it right. In the end,its a simple story about the past of a group of people.</p>
<p><strong>Additional Notes:</strong><br />
•The article will include the logs and research created by their group<br />
•In the article,the survivor will state that his curse was the inability to leave the Headquarters and the tombs.He states that &quot;the others were not so lucky.&quot;</p>
<p>•If there is anything that seems off,please tell me.</p>

