														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4829770">
									

<p>I’m making an image for my German anart SCP based on the journals they would find with it, and it would really help to have some sad/crazy German ramblings, as that would help sell the story. I could use Google but that wouldn’t be accurate, and anyone who knew German would possibly downvote. I’m very willing to read and critique drafts or whatever in return, but I can’t greenlight anything.</p>
<p>Here are some bits I have in mind:</p>
<ul>
<li>Too creepy?</li>
<li>I don’t belong here</li>
<li>happy (just confirming, it’s glücklich, right?)</li>
<li>I just want it to be over</li>
<li>Pay electric bills!</li>
<li>The smile haunts me…</li>
<li>Let me out of this life</li>
<li>When will the night come?</li>
<li>cuter proportions = happier, but might not work</li>
<li>Am I going crazy?</li>
</ul>

