														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4829763">
									

<p>This could use some elaborating. It can only move its head and torso, but it's swift? Does it float around? The idea of an SCP that decays things is interesting, but it also making duplicates might be too much. Then again, it could make sense if it was absorbing the nutrients to clone itself. I don't see the need for it to be a statue of a human too, any kind of strange living creature could work. Either way, the idea could use some refinement, but it has good potential.</p>

