														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4829758">
									

<p>I'm still a newcomer here, but I like it. The idea of a physical space that represents fundamental laws in our universe is pretty fascinating. I also like the narrative potential with the previous universe and some of the machinery being broken. Not sure about the cosmic horror aspect, since its difficult to pull off effectively, but this seems like an idea that's definitely worth writing. Also, to me, this seems like something that could potentially be so integral to the SCP universe that it may be a decent candidate for 001. Again, still new, so take my opinion for whatever it's worth.</p>

