<p>A sculpture of a human, approximately 2 feet tall. It has keen sight despite having no eyes. It is swift despite having no limbs. It shows aggression at the morning, and immobility at night. It can move it's head, and torso. Every time a subject touches the sculpture, they will start to decay. It can make duplicates of itself, using it's body. It can make duplicates of itself by growing an instance at it's torso. The instance, even though it isn't fully grown, can also decay subjects. Every instance will have the decaying effect to subjects.</p>

